
/*
QUERY NAME: Courses Without Institutional Hierarchy Assignments

PURPOSE:
Identifies Blackboard Learn courses that are not assigned
to an active institutional hierarchy relationship.

DATA SOURCES:
- CDM_LMS.COURSE: Course details, status, and timestamps.
- CDM_LMS.TERM: Academic term names and dates.
- CDM_LMS.INSTITUTION_HIERARCHY_COURSE:
  Links courses to institutional hierarchy assignments.

FIELDS RETURNED:
Course ID, course number, course name, term information,
availability/enabled indicators, and creation/modification times.

FILTERING:
- Excludes courses marked as deleted.
- Uses LEFT JOIN to check for hierarchy assignments
  where ROW_DELETED_TIME IS NULL.
- Includes only courses with no matching undeleted
  institutional hierarchy assignment.
- Includes courses regardless of availability or enabled status.

SORTING:
Results are sorted by term start date, course number,
and course name in ascending order.

NOTES:
- Courses without an associated term are still included.
- A course with only deleted hierarchy assignments is included.
- The query does not filter by academic year or term.
- Results can help identify courses missing institutional
  hierarchy assignments for review or correction.
*/

SELECT
    c.ID,
    c.COURSE_NUMBER,
    c.NAME AS COURSE_NAME,
    c.TERM_ID,
    t.NAME AS TERM_NAME,
    t.START_DATE AS TERM_START_DATE,
    t.END_DATE AS TERM_END_DATE,
    c.AVAILABLE_IND,
    c.ENABLED_IND,
    c.CREATED_TIME,
    c.MODIFIED_TIME
FROM CDM_LMS.COURSE c
LEFT JOIN CDM_LMS.TERM t
    ON t.ID = c.TERM_ID
LEFT JOIN CDM_LMS.INSTITUTION_HIERARCHY_COURSE ihc
    ON ihc.COURSE_ID = c.ID
    AND ihc.ROW_DELETED_TIME IS NULL
WHERE c.ROW_DELETED_TIME IS NULL
    AND ihc.COURSE_ID IS NULL
ORDER BY
    t.START_DATE,
    c.COURSE_NUMBER,
    c.NAME;
